$ Al-V
$
$ B. Lindahl, X.L. Liu, Z.-K. Liu, M. Selleby, Calphad, 51, 75-88(2015).
$
$ Checked against paper. Checked at 6000 K.
$
$ Modified to be compatible with mpea-04.
$ AL8V5_D82 is changed to a 2-sl 8:5 model.
$ AlV3 (A15) is tentatively added based on ab initio calculations from 18Ber.
$ It is completely unclear how 18Ber derived their parameters, since
$ AlV3 has never been observed experimentally.
$ The Al45V7 model is not compatible with the Al7Cr model, but that will
$ have to wait until Al-Cr-V is modelled. Probably the Al7Cr model is not
$ compatible with the crystal structure.
$
