$ 2023.08.22: G(MV3_A15,CO:CR) removed because MV3_A15 becomes stable in Co-Cr
$             below 673 K.
$
$ The SIGMA_D8B phase field is more narrow than SIGMA_OLD and does not agree
$ as well with experimental data. It is rather close to the sigma phase field
$ in the later assessment from 16Li though.
