$ Mn-V
$
$ From W. Huang 1991 (Included in LB Vol. 4)
$
$ W. Huang, Calphad, 15, 195-208(1991).
$
$ Checked against LB and paper. Checked at 6000K.
$
$ Endmember value for G(SIGMA_D8B,V:V:V) changed from 02Sun to 06Slu.
$ This causes a slight decrease of the V solubility in sigma.
$ This is not included in the 91Hua binary dataset.
$
$ W. Huang used the 8:4:18 model for the sigma phase (SIGMA_OLD). This was
$ changed to 10:4:16 (SIGMA_D8B) for LB. The change of model only slightly
$ changes the V-rich side of the sigma phase field.
$
