$ ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
$ Al-Co-Cr
$
$ X.L. Liu, G. Lindwall, T. Gheno, Z.-K. Liu, Calphad, 52, 125-42(2016).
$
$ Checked against paper and author's tdb.
$
$ Al-Co is from 20Noo instead of 16Liu.
$ Al-Cr is from 17Wan2 instead of 98Sau, further modified in mod3.
$ Fcc changed from 2SL to 4SL.
$ SIGMA_OLD is changed to SIGMA_D8B (using the same
$ Al-Cr and Al-Co-Cr parameters).
$
$ Compared to mod2 the fcc and hcp interactions, AL8CR5_D810 model,
$ AlCr2 stability and sigma (metastable) in Al-Cr have been changed.
$ The ternary fcc interaction used in mod2 could be removed.
$
$ The fcc phase field is close to previously. Changes in A2/B2 equilibria are
$ small. The sigma phase field is slightly smaller.
$
$ The Al-rich part of the phase diagram has been experimentally investigated
$ in detail by Grushko et al. 2018 (J. Alloys Compd., 739, 280-89(2018).
$ This part of the system has not yet been modelled.
$
 PAR  L(LIQUID,AL,CO,CR;0),,            +30000;,,                     N 15Liu !
$
 PAR  G(FCC_4SL,AL:AL:CO:CR:VA),,       +FAL2COCR;,,                  N 16Liu !
 PAR  G(FCC_4SL,CO:CO:AL:CR:VA),,       +FALCO2CR;,,                  N 16Liu !
 PAR  G(FCC_4SL,CR:CR:AL:CO:VA),,       +FALCOCR2;,,                  N 16Liu !
$
 PAR  L(BCC_A2,AL,CO,CR:VA;0),,         -28128;,,                     N 16Liu !
 PAR  L(BCC_A2,AL,CO,CR:VA;1),,         +123468-61.879*T;,,           N 16Liu !
 PAR  L(BCC_A2,AL,CO,CR:VA;2),,         -12107-32.267*T;,,            N 16Liu !
$
 PAR  L(A2_BCC,AL,CO,CR:VA;0),,         -28128;,,                     N 16Liu !
 PAR  L(A2_BCC,AL,CO,CR:VA;1),,         +123468-61.879*T;,,           N 16Liu !
 PAR  L(A2_BCC,AL,CO,CR:VA;2),,         -12107-32.267*T;,,            N 16Liu !
$
 PAR  L(B2_BCC,AL,CO:CR:VA;0),,         -30895;,,                     N 16Liu !
 PAR  L(B2_BCC,CR:AL,CO:VA;0),,         -30895;,,                     N 16Liu !
 PAR  L(B2_BCC,CO,CR:AL:VA;0),,         -11069;,,                     N 16Liu !
 PAR  L(B2_BCC,AL:CO,CR:VA;0),,         -11069;,,                     N 16Liu !
$
 PAR  L(HCP_A3,AL,CO,CR:VA;0),,         +25000;,,                     N 15Liu !
$
 PAR  G(SIGMA_D8B,AL:CR:CO),,           +10*GHSERAL+4*GHSERCR
             +16*GBCCCO-617537;,,                                     N 15Liu !
 PAR  G(SIGMA_D8B,CO:CR:AL),,           +10*GFCCCO+4*GHSERCR
             +16*GBCCAL-931862;,,                                     N 15Liu !
 PAR  L(SIGMA_D8B,CO:CR:AL,CR;0),,      -200000;,,                    N 16Liu !
$
$ Metastable
$
 PAR  G(AL3NI2_D513,AL:CR:CO),,         +3*GBCCAL+2*GHSERCR+GBCCCO;,, N Lin !
$
 PAR  G(GAMMA_D810,AL:CO:CR),,          +12*GHSERAL+5*GHSERCO
             +9*GHSERCR;,,                                            N Lin !
$
 FUNCTION U1ALCOCR  298.15  0.0;                                       6000 N !
 FUNCTION U2ALCOCR  298.15  0.0;                                       6000 N !
 FUNCTION U3ALCOCR  298.15  0.0;                                       6000 N !
 FUNCTION FALCOCR2  298.15  +UFALCO+2*UFALCR+2*UFCOCR+U1ALCOCR;        6000 N !
 FUNCTION FALCO2CR  298.15  +2*UFALCO+UFALCR+2*UFCOCR+U2ALCOCR;        6000 N !
 FUNCTION FAL2COCR  298.15  +2*UFALCO+2*UFALCR+UFCOCR+U3ALCOCR;        6000 N !
