$ Co-Mn-Ni
$
$ B. Hallstedt, unpublished, 2020.
$
$ MnNi-L10 and MnNi3-L12 extend far into the ternary at lower temperature when
$ the ordering contributions are just added. They were tentatively modified
$ to reduce the extension.
$
