$ Co-Mn-V
$
$ Not yet modelled.
$
$ Experimental data in J.J. Ruan et al. 2014. Sigma should extend between
$ Co-V and Mn-V, but does not. It's stability should be somewhat increased,
$ but probably not by very much. Other phases seem fairly reasonable.
$
