$ Cr-Mn-C
$
$ B.-J. Lee, Metall. Trans. A, 24A, 1017-25 (1993).
$
$ Checked against paper.
$
$ Cr-C modified by 12Khv.
$ Sigma and high-sigma changed from 8:4:18 to 10:4:16 in Cr-Mn.
$ New Mn-C from 10Dju.
$
$ The BCC_A2 interaction is the same as without C. This is either without
$ influence on anything or wrong. The same applies for FCC_A1, HCP_A3,
$ CBCC_A12 and CUB_A13.
$
$ The HCP_A3 interaction is necessary, but is now different from the one
$ without C.
$
