$
$ B.-J. Lee, Calphad, 16, 121-49(1992).
$
$ Cr-C modified by 12Khv.
$ New Cr-Ni from 16Tan.
$ Ni-C modified by 06Hal1.
$ Cr-Ni-C modified by 06Hal2.
$
 PAR  L(FCC_A1,CR,NI:C;0),,             +ZERO;,,                      N 06Hal3 !
